                        "entry_id": "61ebb864-5805-3e23-b12c-59addb38df10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Maladie pulmonaire provoquée par l’inhalation de particules de poussière de silice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f984c9d3-86ff-46b1-9285-6602287d0539",
                                "sense_id": "a0ea15dc-deef-3967-bcfe-ab76583d1bc7",
                                "text": "Ces dernières années, telle une Erin Brockovich sud-africaine, elle a sillonné Welkom et ses environs pour recenser les mineurs atteints de silicose, cette maladie pulmonaire provoquée par une particule de poussière présente dans les souterrains."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1152c23e-96f6-415c-ab09-af4844968374",
                        "source_entry_id": "61ebb864-5805-3e23-b12c-59addb38df10",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0ea15dc-deef-3967-bcfe-ab76583d1bc7",
                        "target_lang_word": "silicosis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silicosis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed1872ad-a9b6-3e96-afe1-a685aebb4f4c",
                                        "entry_id": "3e4fc2eb-5de5-35a5-8206-82f456dd5a0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A disease of the lungs caused by the inhalation of crystalline silica dust."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f972e21-daa8-4556-b8be-e68064a431eb",
                                                "sense_id": "ed1872ad-a9b6-3e96-afe1-a685aebb4f4c",
                                                "text": "Well, minin’ is a hazard in Hazard, Kentucky, and if you ain’t minin’ there, well, my friends, you’re awful lucky, ‘Cause if you don’t get silicosis, or pay that’s just atrocious, you’ll be screamin’ for a union that will care"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40b8df2d-634b-4498-9a70-799cf239b089",
                        "source_entry_id": "61ebb864-5805-3e23-b12c-59addb38df10",
                        "source_sense_id": "a0ea15dc-deef-3967-bcfe-ab76583d1bc7",
                        "target_lang_word": "pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f96de8a-088f-38d9-b07e-0a194e858288",
                                        "entry_id": "38dfbb48-c672-33bb-9a17-c6816c756a4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A disease of the lungs, allegedly caused by inhaling microscopic silicate particles originating from the eruption of a volcano."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "nonce-word",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64e9d03f-ef2c-4754-8138-092fd04b5472",
                                                "sense_id": "4f96de8a-088f-38d9-b07e-0a194e858288",
                                                "text": "Call it miner's asthma, silicosis, pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis, coal workers' pneumoconiosis, or black lung—they are all dust diseases with the same symptoms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8295020-f72e-47f9-9d5c-98883a105c5c",
                                                "sense_id": "4f96de8a-088f-38d9-b07e-0a194e858288",
                                                "text": "I say that it must be the silica dust\nThat we breathed through our mouths and our noses\nThat brought pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a13d1bb7-34ae-40d3-9d32-409f4bc5dc02",
                                                "sense_id": "4f96de8a-088f-38d9-b07e-0a194e858288",
                                                "text": "It's either pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis, or a bad cough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a9d3c4c-3bd7-469a-ae76-c609d6d2ca66",
                                                "sense_id": "4f96de8a-088f-38d9-b07e-0a194e858288",
                                                "text": "I still can't watch House M.D. and not have my mind wonder[…] Even I can fear of^([sic]) having Pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis after watching it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f599ba8-66cd-4735-95e3-df212a72e6d0",
                                                "sense_id": "4f96de8a-088f-38d9-b07e-0a194e858288",
                                                "text": "Regarding the lack of funding and attention do you agree that there should be parity of esteem between mental conditions such as body dysmorphia and physical conditions such as pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
